if {FirstJanitor} == true:
	janitor: Hello there.
	janitor: I see you've escaped the zombies.
	janitor: No one comes to this floor except me, so it's safe.
	janitor: You can come to this floor whenever you need to take a breather.
	set {FirstJanitor} = false
else:
	janitor: Hello again.
label Questions
janitor: Do you have any questions?
- Safe room.
	janitor: You're safe in here. You can use the vending machine or the crafting table if you want.\

	jump Questions
- Crafting.
	janitor: You can use the crafting table to upgrade your equipment.
	janitor: You can also see what you need to upgrade each piece of equipment.
	jump Questions
- Vending machine.
	janitor: You can use the money you collect to buy crafting components and consumables.
	jump Questions
- Elevator
	janitor: You can use the elevator to go visit one of your bosses.
	janitor: Or you can go to a random floor to collect components to upgrade yourself.
	jump Questions
- Escape.
	janitor: If you want to escape, you must defeat all of the bosses of this corporation. The lower ranked employees have the keys to the higher ranked employees' offices.
	janitor: The head honcho has the keys to the roof. There you can probably contact a rescue helicopter to get out of here.
	jump Questions
- Nothing else for now.
	janitor: See you. Take care.
	[end_timeline]
